orever": 16648, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11228, "last_played": 1727553997, "avatar": "f9ed6fd215299763686dd78cd8b2b7d55ee9e97d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic Game. The developers are actually listening to the player base. Is it perfect? Not by any means but they most certainly are working on it. Honestly, how much complaining can one possibly do on a game that is FREE? Purchases are completely optional unless you just have to have that schoolgirl outfit. (for reasons...) but remember, it is FREE. You will have to grind to get those gibs if you don't want to make some purchases and there is nothing wrong with that. The majority of bad reviews are just from people crying about the drop rate on materials.", "timestamp_created": 1725746244, "timestamp_updated": 1725800398, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174475591", "author": {"steamid": "76561199584404234", "personaname": "Kiara <3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199584404234/", "num_games_owned": 21, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 370, "last_played": 1783178507, "avatar": "f17c5fd2c31e756da94a3037cf66437279972c6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "vErY fUn", "timestamp_created": 1725746018, "timestamp_updated": 1725746018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174474955", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978048134", "personaname": "truwrecks", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197978048134/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 49748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 46337, "last_played": 1760047359, "avatar": "e67815f5785ed5f1b471b7aa33ea5f92386632e5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Currently I am not going to recommend this game to anyone. This had a good concept at first. Combine gun fights with elemental skills. That was fun.\n\nNow there are enemies that disable all player skills in many events and boss fights that are required if you want to get any of the unique weapons or different characters. Then you need a lot of HP and defense, and a really strong gun.\n\nThis game became Destiny 2.\n\nUpdate: S1 release has definitely lost the uniqueness this game had. It is now a \"Get the biggest gun\" game like Destiny 2. A ton of game play modes disable RK skills so guns are the only option. Thank devs! You have ruined the game.\n\nEdit: Season 3 has improved game play dramatically and it feels more like it was in Season 1, but on hard difficulty. The drop rates for research items still feels fixed and grindy, but overall game play is more entertaining again.", "timestamp_created": 1725745307, "timestamp_updated": 1754775994, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174473932", "author": {"steamid": "76561199371135615", "personaname": "RGI_Player_1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199371135615/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 439, "last_played": 1782842487, "avatar": "d67b3663429d7a5ad99e4f0a10266ef0b1524610"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like the game everything was perfect until the recent update, Nexon please fix your game, after your update i cant even play it becouse of the easy anti cheat problem, even if i cant manage to open the game it crashesh everytime im on the loading screen", "timestamp_created": 1725744235, "timestamp_updated": 1725744235, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174473838", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074190211", "personaname": "FSanPORTE", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074190211/", "num_games_owned": 329, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 6065, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6065, "last_played": 1725744002, "avatar": "3859789043efe49dd5c3b050808e88093b9ffe20"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pre-season was fun. Devs seem responsive to feedback.\r\nSeason 1 is absolutely terrible with the worst designed missions I have ever played. It went from \"pretty fun\" to \"worst time I've ever had in a game\" basically instantly when season 1 launched.\r\nThey had a decade of Destiny and Warframe to look at to design fun missions. They've learned nothing.", "timestamp_created": 1725744145, "timestamp_updated": 1725744145, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174473822", "author": {"steamid": "76561198267748837", "personaname": "The Viking", "persona_status": "offline", "p